cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Specification Foundation"
abstract: >-
  The foundation of a specification language: what must be expressible for a
  specification's completeness to be decidable. Projects from actor-indexed
  determination; peer of Decision-Driven Design. Holds the construct list, the
  resolution condition, the boundary declarations, and the conformance
  criterion.
type: software
